<<^ code=`&#x0002;`>>

```toml meta
cacheable = true
l-space   = "stable"
role      = "get the face's verified kahua stage at two grains"
tags      = ["lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance", "lar:///face.draft.reads"]
title     = "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/face.draft.reads"
