uri-path  = "ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/face.draft.reads"
```

<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! face.draft.reads ~ the list of verified items, or one title and its history

`kahua get` reads the stage's VERIFIED items, the fold, never a raw tiddler. Without a title it lists bounded items with source, count, relation and continuation (`--after` and `--limit` page it); a fresh face answers `stage: "none"`. With a title it returns the verified item or null, and with `--history` every revision of that title. A staged row rests in `bags/daemon-<F>` and lists here once its lift lands. The bare list stands for the old `kahua list`, which now answers only to name its move here. Reads alone: it writes nothing, and the seat's tool rides a `seat` session.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ the-stage · one-title · with-history

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`the-stage` params=`face/1 ~ list the stage's lifted items`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`one-title` params=`title/T face/1 ~ one verified item`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`with-history` params=`title/T history face/1 ~ every revision of the title`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ title · history · after · limit · face

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`title` params=`takes/title seat/1 as/<title> ~ one title's verified item; absent, the list`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`history` params=`~ every revision of the title; needs a title`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`after` params=`takes/cursor ~ the continuation a list answered; a title refuses list pagination`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`limit` params=`takes/count ~ a positive whole row count for the list page`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`face` params=`takes/handle-index ~ any face inside the lent set, by persona index (a whole number from 0); absent, the worn face`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ read

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`read` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ a read of the verified stage; it writes nothing, and a seat or a hand reads alike`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ history-needs-a-title · title-refuses-pagination · limit-malformed

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`history-needs-a-title` params=`cure/[[face.draft.reads title/T history]] ~ the door says 'get --history needs a title': history names one title's revisions, and the list carries none`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`title-refuses-pagination` params=`cure/[[face.draft.reads title/T]] ~ a title answers one item and takes no after or limit: 'a title refuses list pagination'`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`limit-malformed` params=`cure/[[face.draft.reads limit/20]] ~ limit takes a positive whole row count`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ listed · item

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`listed` params=`exit/0 fields/[[source count relation next]] ~ bounded verified items with a continuation; a fresh face reads stage none`>>
<<has entity=`band` name=`item` params=`exit/0 ~ one verified item (or null) and, with history, its revisions`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli · mcp

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares kahua get

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host spells/[[lares kahua get]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/mcp`>>

!!! kahua_get

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`mcp` params=`spells/kahua_get ~ the seat; reads alone`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

